<title>GREECE: BOFA'S LIAKOPOULOS GOES TO ABN-AMRO BANK, ATHENS.</title>
<headline>BOFA'S LIAKOPOULOS GOES TO ABN-AMRO BANK, ATHENS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of America's bond trader Aris Liakopoulos moved to ABN-AMRO Bank, Athens and will take over its bond desk, dealers said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
